A||N||7||Runner||Steering Wheel||||1||
Z||000000||Runner||06-11-2000||05:43 PM||||Have have an 86 SE with a 4 spoke steering wheel and a rectangular centre piece with two small horn paddles on the narrow ends of the rectangular centre between the spokes.<BR>I broke one of the paddles and my manual does not indicate how to remove the centre cover or the horn paddles.<BR>Any idea how I remove the centre section and where I might buy a replacement paddle ?<BR>Runne||||reg||1
Z||000001||ka4nkf||06-11-2000||06:11 PM||||The center piece with the fiero emblem just snaps off, just stick a small drive under one side and it will pop off. The last time I saw some paddles for sell , they were on E-Bay.The paddles are held in place with a screw I think. anyway you will see when you get center cover off.||||reg||1
Z||000002||My7Fieros||06-11-2000||06:11 PM||||Center section of the wheel just pulls right off. Just grab it where the broken horn paddle is and pull it off. Fierostore carrys the paddles I think, I got mine from a junkyard, paid a buck for both! When you pull the center piece off, youll see how easy it is to install the new paddle. Be careful not to break the black plastic tabs that hold the paddles on though.||||reg||1
Z||000003||theogre||06-11-2000||09:15 PM||||that wheel is used in a number of GM cars. The paddle switches should still be available. You may be able to repair it.<P>each switch is held by 2 screws to the wheel. the horn wire is removed the same way as a turn signal lamp. push it in and turn then it pops up.<P>read the article in the cave(follow the link at bottom of this page)||||reg||1
Z||000004||2M4 Dale||06-11-2000||10:58 PM||||Use some good epoxy like JBWeld and glue it back on. As long as you don't use it for a handle it should be OK||||reg||1
Z||000005||Monkeyman||06-12-2000||04:03 PM||||And if you absolutely have to have another horn button, may I suggest either Doug Kinney or Fierodave?||||reg||1
Z||000006||tgowens||06-12-2000||04:10 PM||||or, check with the Fiero Shop - I know he has them, I was there yesterday.......{url}www.fieroshop.net/{/url}||||reg||1
